o prove the declared physical phenomenon: \u25aa Photographic record with date, time and UTM coordinates of the failure point. \u25aa Reports the number of times that the installation has been affected by this cause, with or without supply affectation. d.3 Repetition: Repetition Physical phenomena in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Repetition Physical phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: There have been no failures","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 489/2025\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada del transformador N\u00b01 66/13.2 kV de S/E Longav\u00ed\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 28-11-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 09/11/2025\nHora 22:33\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 6.10\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 9241.09\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.132 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n Transformador 66/13.2 kV N\u00b01 de S/E Longav\u00ed / ET02T0059SE001T0059\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Transformador 2D\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66/13.2 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada Luzparral Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.470.427-2\nRepresentante Legal Francisco Sol\u00eds Ganga\nDirecci\u00f3n An\u00edbal Pinto N\u00b01101, Parral.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Transformador 66/13.2 kV N\u00b01 de S/E Longav\u00ed / ET02T0059SE001T0059\nPropietario elemento fallado Luzparral Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.470.427-2\nRepresentante Legal Francisco Sol\u00eds Ganga\nDirecci\u00f3n An\u00edbal Pinto N\u00b01101, Parral.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada del transformador 66/13. kV de S/E Longav\u00ed, por operaci\u00f3n de su\nprotecci\u00f3n diferencial, enviando orden de apertura sobre sus interruptores 52BT1 y 52C1.\nLa empresa Luzparral Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. se\u00f1ala que la falla fue ocasionada por la presencia de un gato\nentre los bushings MT del transformador y la parte met\u00e1lica del mismo, acortando la distancia\ndiel\u00e9ctrica.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nANI1: Acci\u00f3n de animales, roedores o p\u00e1jaros (por contacto directo u otro).\nLa empresa Luzparral Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. envi\u00f3 los siguientes antecedentes probatorios para acreditar el\nfen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico declarado:\n\u25aa Registro Fotogr\u00e1fico con fecha, hora y coordenadas UTM del pu","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":-0.01},{"w":"failure","s":0.07},{"w":"eaf","s":-0.02},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"forced","s":0.05},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.05},{"w":"transformer","s":1.0},{"w":"66","s":0.21},{"w":"13","s":0.01},{"w":"kv","s":0.03},{"w":"description","s":0.02},{"w":"time","s":-0.01},{"w":"failure","s":0.07},{"w":"09","s":-0.09},{"w":"11","s":-0.21},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"time","s":-0.01},{"w":"22","s":-0.01},{"w":"consumption","s":0.08},{"w":"mw","s":-0.14},{"w":"10","s":-0.07},{"w":"mw","s":-0.14},{"w":"09","s":-0.09},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.02},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.05}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"transformer_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.0495,"breaker_fault":0.02,"transformer_fault":0.8611,"busbar_fault":0.0694},"confidence":0.8611,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"transformer_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.2718,"breaker_fault":0.127,"transformer_fault":0.4447,"busbar_fault":0.1565},"confidence":0.4447,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"transformer_fault","probs":{"line_fault":0.1029,"breaker_fault":0.1685,"transformer_fault":0.5818,"busbar_fault":0.1468},"confidence":0.5818,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.2243,"signed":-0.2485},"T":{"share":0.2195,"signed":0.2433}